{"name":"Bedrock","hex":"#9e9d99","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bedrock","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The solid rock found at some depth below the ground surface.","A basis or foundation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To establish on a solid foundation."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bedrock"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bedrock","blocks":[{"text":"In geology, bedrock is the solid rock that lies under weathered rock and unconsolidated or loose superficial deposits in the near surface part of Earth's crust or the crust of another terrestrial planet. The top of the bedrock is known as rockhead."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Rockhead_at_Sandside_Bay%2C_Caithness%2C_Scotland.jpg/330px-Rockhead_at_Sandside_Bay%2C_Caithness%2C_Scotland.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bedrock","wikidata":"Q570309"},{"title":"BedRock","blocks":[{"text":"\"BedRock\" is the second single by hip hop group/record label Young Money Entertainment from their debut collaboration album, We Are Young Money (2009). It is performed by acts that were signed under Young Money, including rap verses by Lil Wayne, Gudda Gudda, Nicki Minaj as her debut single, Drake, Tyga, Jae Millz, with the chorus performed by Lloyd. \"BedRock\" is also featured as a bonus track on the Japanese, New Zealand, and the \"Complete Edition\" 2020 reissue editions of Nicki Minaj's debut studio album, Pink Friday and is also featured on Lil Wayne's greatest hits album I Am Music."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/09/BedRock.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BedRock","wikidata":"Q3637407"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"bedrock":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-bedrock.wav?utm_source=